#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:1
msgid "固件与输出协议选择"
msgstr "Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "选择原则"
msgstr "Selection Principles"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:6
msgid ""
"**4G / LoRa 表示差分数据来源，NMEA / UBX 表示对外输出协议。** D20 地面版默认 "
"10 Hz NMEA，无人机版默认 10 Hz UBX；D13 默认输出 10 Hz NMEA，可按需求配置为 "
"UBX。"
msgstr ""
"**4G / LoRa identifies the correction source, while NMEA / UBX identifies "
"the external output protocol.** D20 ground firmware defaults to 10 Hz NMEA, "
"and UAV firmware defaults to 10 Hz UBX. D13 defaults to 10 Hz NMEA and can "
"be configured for UBX on request."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:9
msgid "出厂固件选择"
msgstr "Factory Firmware Selection"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "产品"
msgstr "Product"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "目标设备"
msgstr "Target device"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "固件"
msgstr "Firmware"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "默认输出"
msgstr "Default output"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "HM-D20"
msgstr "HM-D20"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "ArduPilot、PX4 等飞控"
msgstr "Flight controllers such as ArduPilot and PX4"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "无人机版"
msgstr "UAV firmware"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "10 Hz UBX"
msgstr "10 Hz UBX"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "Viobot2、机器人主控、PC"
msgstr "Viobot2, robot main controller, PC"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "地面版"
msgstr "Ground firmware"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "10 Hz NMEA"
msgstr "10 Hz NMEA"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "HM-D13"
msgstr "HM-D13"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "地面设备、机器人主控、PC"
msgstr "Ground equipment, robot main control, PC"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:3
msgid "10 Hz NMEA；可按需求配置 UBX"
msgstr "10 Hz NMEA; UBX can be configured as needed"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:17
msgid ""
"RTK 最高更新率为 10 Hz，默认 10 Hz 是当前标准交付配置。修改输出前，需要确认串"
"口带宽、消息数量和下游设备兼容性；PVT 与 RAW 原始数据的频率边界见[产品对比与"
"资料](../../products/comparison.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The RTK maximum update rate is 10 Hz, and the default 10 Hz is the current "
"standard delivery configuration. Before modifying the output, it is "
"necessary to confirm the serial port bandwidth, the number of messages, and "
"downstream device compatibility; the frequency boundaries of PVT and RAW "
"data can be found in [Product Comparison and Resources](../../products/"
"comparison.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:20
msgid ""
"**下单时直接说明目标平台：** 说明计划接入的飞控、机器人主控或 PC，以及所需 "
"NMEA / UBX 输出，可按用途完成出厂配置。"
msgstr ""
"**Specify the target platform when placing the order:** Indicate the flight "
"controller, robot main controller, or PC you plan to connect to, as well as "
"the required NMEA/UBX output, so that the factory configuration can be "
"completed according to the intended use."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:24
msgid "输出检查"
msgstr "Output Check"

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:26
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"NMEA 输出：按{ref}`连接 NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>`或在串口控制台中确"
"认 NMEA 语句持续刷新。"
msgstr ""
"NMEA output: Follow {ref}`Connecting to NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>` "
"or check in the serial console to confirm that NMEA messages are "
"continuously refreshing."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:27
msgid ""
"UBX 输出：通过目标飞控、地面站或其他兼容设备确认定位数据和状态持续更新。"
msgstr ""
"UBX Output: Confirm that positioning data and status are continuously "
"updated through the target flight controller, ground station, or other "
"compatible devices."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:28
msgid "默认串口波特率：115200 bps。"
msgstr "Default serial port baud rate: 115200 bps."

#: ../../source/rtk/operation/firmware-output.md:30
msgid ""
"需要修改输出频率或消息项时，使用[常用参数配置](../maintenance/parameters."
"md)。需要更换固件时，先确认目标平台，再按[固件升级](../maintenance/firmware-"
"update.md)操作。"
msgstr ""
"When you need to modify the output frequency or message items, use [Common "
"Parameter Configuration](../maintenance/parameters.md). When you need to "
"replace the firmware, first confirm the target platform, then follow the "
"[Firmware Upgrade](../maintenance/firmware-update.md) procedure."
